From 8d9fc00d91e9811201f575748e21cc790ffa6c70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marc Lainez <marc.lainez@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 01:04:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 22/26] ARM: dts: qcom: msm8226-samsung-s3ve3g: describe the
 battery, enable the BMS

The OCV tables, design capacity and resistance are the vendor BMS
profile this phone selects (samsung_2100mAH_data); the 10 mOhm sense
resistor and the 3.4 V cutoff come from the vendor PMIC description.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 .../dts/qcom/qcom-msm8226-samsung-s3ve3g.dts  | 64 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 64 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/boot/dts/qcom/qcom-msm8226-samsung-s3ve3g.dts b/arch/arm/boot/dts/qcom/qcom-msm8226-samsung-s3ve3g.dts
index 67d613f6e3a5..12a5c7792c19 100644
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/qcom/qcom-msm8226-samsung-s3ve3g.dts
